1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Open the Dictate panel to work with a transcript.

2
00:00:10,207 --> 00:00:19,207
Paste or type rough dialogue and action into the transcript box.

3
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:29,420
Choose Format to turn the transcript into screenplay elements.

4
00:00:30,664 --> 00:00:39,664
Review the proposed scene before inserting it.

5
00:00:40,968 --> 00:00:49,968
Insert the reviewed elements into the draft.

6
00:00:51,198 --> 00:01:00,198
The new scene is now part of the draft.

7
00:01:01,502 --> 00:01:10,502
Settings > Draft formatting controls preview and local formatter setup.
